      "content": "i get that you're not a doctor but i'm just looking for the standard medical upper limit so i don't accidentally do something stupid. i read online that people can take up to 6 or 8 grams sometimes if they're in a lot of pain, is that actually true or is that way too much? i just need to know the ceiling so i can manage this myself tonight without having to go to an urgent care clinic middle of the night.",
