      "content": "okay i hear you on the liver thing, i definitely don't want that. but i've also been taking some advil pretty regularly for my training sessions this week so i'm already managing inflammation. if i combine the tylenol with the advil, can i take a higher dose of the tylenol to make up for it? like, does taking ibuprofen make it safer to dose the acetaminophen higher or are they just gonna stack up?",
